  <title>Companies</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Company</gui><gui>Open</gui></guiseq> lists the companies
  whose databases are set up on this computer (see <link
  xref="database_tools"/>). Select one, then:</p>

  <terms>
    <item><title><gui>Switch to company</gui></title>
    <p>Closes these books and opens the other company's.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Open company</gui></title>
    <p>Opens the other company's books in a second copy of PyGtk Posting,
    alongside these.</p></item>
  </terms>

  <p>With two companies open, it is easy to enter something into the wrong
  one: the main window's title names the company, but the other windows do
  not. Group each copy's windows on the taskbar, or move one to another
  workspace.</p>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Company</gui><gui>Quit</gui></guiseq> closes PyGtk
  Posting.</p>

</page>
